@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@etag = *

### Stable response: repeat three times and check the server console
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Conditional header does not change the response: expect 200 and the full body
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
If-None-Match: {{etag}}

### QUERY with a request body
QUERY {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"maxPrice":100}

### Different query, separate analysis history
QUERY {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"maxPrice":300}

### Changing response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/live

### Unanalyzed endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Excluded HTTP method
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Larger stable JSON: repeat three times, inspect console recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/large-json

### Random data changes at the same URL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/random-json

### Repeat six times: A,A,A,B,B,B (restart the host to reset)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/mixed-json

### Stable plain text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/text

### Stable XML
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/xml

### Actual CSV file attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/csv-file

### Deterministic 256 KiB binary attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/binary-file

### 4 MiB attachment: full body returned, hashing skipped
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scenarios/oversized-file
